<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Tender of the Soul"><PageHero eyebrow="Privacy" title="Privacy policy" intro="How information submitted through this website is handled."/><section class="section"><div class="narrow prose"><p><strong>Last updated: July 2026</strong></p><h2>Information you share</h2><p>When you submit the contact form, this site may collect your name, email address, phone number, meeting preference, and the message you provide. Please do not submit highly sensitive health or medical information through the website.</p><h2>How it is used</h2><p>Information is used to respond to your inquiry, discuss potential services, and maintain necessary administrative records. It is not sold.</p><h2>Website services</h2><p>The hosting provider and form-processing provider may process basic technical data and form submissions in order to operate this site. Their practices are governed by their respective privacy terms. Final hosting and form providers must be identified here before launch.</p><h2>Retention and requests</h2><p>Inquiry information is retained only as long as reasonably needed for communication, administration, or legal obligations. To request access, correction, or deletion, contact [add practice email].</p><h2>Before publication</h2><p>This policy is a practical starting template and must be reviewed and updated by a qualified professional based on the chosen host, form provider, analytics, applicable law, and the practice’s actual procedures.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
